    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Don't Want To",
      "",
      "One evening, Little Ming's dad was lying on the sofa playing with his phone.",
      "Little Ming's mom was sitting on the sofa watching TV, …",
      "… and Little Ming was sitting by the table next to the sofa quietly doing his homework.",
      "",
      "Little Ming's dad really liked this type of evening, so he said:",
      "“I wish time would stop. Our son wouldn't grow old, and he could be by our side forever.”",
      "",
      "When Little Ming heard this, he shouted: “No! I don't want to do homework forever!”"
